title: "ESP32 environmental sensor node firmware"
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/pvamos/esp32-envsensor-mqtt"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - "environmental monitoring"
  - "sensor network"
  - "ESP32-C3"
  - "BME280"
  - "SHT4X"
  - "MQTT"
  - "Protocol Buffers"
  - "IoT"
  - "embedded systems"
abstract: >-
  ESP-IDF firmware for low-cost environmental sensor nodes used in a scalable environmental monitoring network. The firmware reads BME280 and SHT4X sensors, encodes measurements with Protocol Buffers, publishes them over MQTTS, and uses deep sleep between measurement cycles.
